** ELEMENT DEFINITIONS (2D 4-node acoustic elements)
** ============================================================================
*ELEMENT, TYPE=AC2D4, ELSET=ALL_ELEMENTS
** Generate structured quad elements
** Element connectivity for structured mesh
*ELGEN, ELSET=LAYER1_ELEMS
1, 400, 1, 1, 60, 401, 401
*ELGEN, ELSET=LAYER2_ELEMS  
24001, 400, 1, 1, 80, 401, 401
*ELGEN, ELSET=LAYER3_ELEMS
56001, 400, 1, 1, 60, 401, 401
**
** ============================================================================
** ELEMENT SETS FOR LAYERS (based on depth)
** ============================================================================
** Layer 1: Surface (z = 0-15m, elements 1-24000)
*ELSET, ELSET=LAYER1, GENERATE
1, 24000, 1
** Layer 2: Thermocline (z = 15-35m, elements 24001-56000)  
*ELSET, ELSET=LAYER2, GENERATE
24001, 56000, 1
** Layer 3: Deep (z = 35-50m, elements 56001-80000)
*ELSET, ELSET=LAYER3, GENERATE
56001, 80000, 1
**
